1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,000
The gap is not access. It is making exported evidence understandable, comparable and verifiable.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:25,000
People need a trustworthy history—not assumptions about missing records.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
SOVRIVA is a local-first Digital Identity Intelligence and Privacy Verification Platform.

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Supported exports become understandable insights while original evidence stays preserved locally.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Profile Drift checks coverage before deciding what changed.

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:10,000
It distinguishes newly reported, retained, supported-removed and uncertain-absence records.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Evidence Provenance traces each finding to its platform, source file and specific record.

8
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Privacy Action Verification compares a recorded action with a later export.

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:45,000
The result is an observed change, no change observed, or not verifiable—not a claim about private platform systems.

10
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The Chrome and Edge companion observes request metadata and applies supported advertising and tracker rules.

11
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:15,000
FastAPI, SQLite, Manifest V3, and explainable deterministic algorithms form the current foundation.

12
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Local AI and machine learning are planned for future evaluation—not presented as shipped results.

13
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Target users include privacy-conscious individuals, students, educators and digital privacy researchers.

14
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
A free local core can grow into premium analytical reports and institutional solutions.

15
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:52,000
SOVRIVA helps people understand their digital advertising identity, trace evidence and verify observable changes.

16
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Your Digital Identity. Your Control.
